            "review_title": "Review at Bêp Viêt",
            "review_text": "CPL\nBristol, United Kingdom28 contributions\n0\nPlenty Gluten Free Options\nJul 2026 • Family\nWe visited here on our first night in Hanoi and it was a great find. After doing my research, I found out that they did gluten free options, and as I am a coeliac I added this place to my list. \n\nThe servers were helpful letting me know what I could/couldn't have, my food also came separate. I'd say the fried spring rolls weren't the best, but thats just my preference - The other food tasted amazing!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 23, 2026",
