            "review_text": "Carolinejoy3\nArlecdon 68 contributions\n0\nAs Good as it Gets\nJan 2026 • Couples\nTired and hungry after returning from a long day trip we decided to visit this establishment, which was just opposite our hotel. \nNot really knowing what to eat, the young lady serving made recommendations and we were not disappointed. \nI had Bun Cha and my husband had the beef vegetable stir fry. With a beer and ginger tea, the whole bill came to a very reasonable £8.50. \nIn fact, the food was so good we returned the following lunchtime - again, very good with the same swift service. \nCould not recommend this place highly enough and exceptional value for money.\nRead more\nWritten January 22, 2026",
