            "review_text": "Robert L\nTucson, Arizona30 contributions\n0\nGreat local eatery.\nNov 2025 • Couples\nExcellent, and our go to cafe in the Old Quarter. Great service, (sweet boss lady with bright smile) very good to excellent food always. Lots of choices on large menu, very reasonable!\nSeems to be busier all the time, with a broad array of customers, but we always can find a table.\nA block off Hoan Kiem Lake.\nInsider tip:\nExcellent pho and bun. Hanoi and seafood spring rolls the best! Vegetarian spring rolls pretty good if a little bland.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 4, 2025",
